    q: 'Is it okay to switch my first job early if I do not like it?',
    a: 'Switching quickly makes sense if the role was materially misrepresented or you have a genuine pattern of serious problems, not a hard first few weeks. If it is mostly discomfort or a peer comparison without full information, finish your formal review window first so you have a real performance signal before deciding.',
